      "first": {
        "speaker": 0,
        "line": 1,
        "text": "Kissed them all, I kissed them all, always kissed cats, puss-cats, kissed them, always did; if a cat'd let me kiss it, I'd kiss it-Cat on a fence I'll kiss it-always, always, I will-didn't I?"
